To run your whole project (React frontend + Flask backend), follow these steps:

1. Start the Flask Backend
Open a terminal and run:

cd C:\Users\Daksh\Desktop\main
python call.py

Leave this terminal running.
Your backend will be available at http://localhost:5000.

2. Start the React Frontend
Open a second terminal and run:
cd C:\Users\Daksh\Desktop\main\TourSafe-SIH-25-
npm install        # (only needed the first time)
npm run dev

Your frontend will be available at http://localhost:5173 (or the port shown in the terminal).
